> LOS ANGELES -- USC pitcher Ian Kennedy[ (]Huntington Beach, Calif/La Quinta HS) was named today to the 2004 Baseball America[ Fresh]man All-America Team. Kennedy becomes the third straight Trojan in as many years to[ earn] first team honors (Jeff Clement in[ 2003] and Joey Metropoulos in 2002).
